                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Rivet checks a\npractice packet\nwith four branch\nnames and only\nthree",
                                        "received marks.\nFrostwick, Candy,\nand Brassworks\nhave signed.\nVelvet",
                                        "has a sent entry\nbut no received\nmark. Moxie is\nfree to carry a",
                                        "copy; the lamp\ncard cannot\nconfirm it. Pip\nstarts to count\nthe sent",
                                        "entry as close\nenough, catches\nhimself, and\nleaves the empty\nbox",
                                        "visible. Nib would\nrather answer a\nreal check than be\ncongratulated",
                                        "by assumption."
                                      ],
                                      "avatarId": "",
                                      "minHeight": 4,
